menu "ESP32-P4 platform touch"
    config PLATFORM_TOUCH_ELECROW_10_1_CROSS_REVISION_AUTHORIZED
        bool "Compile the bounded Elecrow 10.1-inch GT911 touch client"
        default n
        help
            Enables only the reviewed cross-revision touch path: a borrowed
            shared I2C1 handle with a 400 kHz GT911 device, GPIO40 reset,
            GPIO42 address-latch/interrupt input, primary 0x5d then cleaned
            0x14 fallback, polling-only runtime with no ISR callback, and
            1024x600 frames with at most five contacts. This build gate does
            not authorize flashing and is not hardware verification.
endmenu
